This directory contains the edits to 
https://github.com/neuraloperator/neuraloperator.git

To use, copy the neuraloperator.git repository locally, update with the
following files, and then added neuraloperator to the python environment. This
was done to study 3+1D distributions of the QGP from X-SCAPE.

From the top git directory `neuraloperator`:

./neuralop/losses/data_losses.py
./neuralop/losses/finite_diff.py
./neuralop/models/fno.py

A *.diff file showing the changes in each file is saved here locally as:
    data_losses.py.diff
    finite_diff.py.diff
    fno.py.diff

